## 1. PROJECT ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, EdTech product designer, graph algorithm engineer, database architect, frontend developer, and QA engineer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, functional, responsive web application for the QUBRIX 12-Hour Internal Hackathon.

**Problem Category:** FULL STACK – EDTECH  
**Problem Number:** Problem 1  
**Problem Title:** Prerequisite-Aware Learning Platform  
**Project Name:** [PROJECT_NAME]

Build a platform where learning is organized around interconnected concepts and prerequisites rather than a simple list of topics.

The platform must ensure that learners understand foundational concepts before moving to advanced concepts. Instructors must be able to modify course structures while learners are actively studying, without losing existing progress or quiz results.

The application must be functional, easy to understand, visually professional, and suitable for a live hackathon demonstration.

